    "Scouting Notes 2": "Was starting to show some pop so far this year before his injury.\n Walking at a much higher rate than in the past.\n Was definitely regaining prospect hype before injury.\n Really solid defender with a decent arm.\n Good speed, and a solid baserunner.\n If the pop holds and the athleticism returns coming off the knee injury, could be a riser in the system.",
